"ws` the same tree is `src/robot-descriptions/` after "
"**`./init_repo.sh`**. Do not recursive-init."
msgstr ""
"公开品牌树作为子模块挂在 [robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions) 下（`common`、`manipulator/ARX`、`manipulator/Dobot` "
"等）。在 `open-deploy-ws` 中，**`./init_repo.sh`** 之后同一棵树是 `src/robot-"
"descriptions/`。不要递归 init。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:20
