#: b3bee5c82bd840bc8097595ce599fc92
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"arx_acone_description/\n"
"├── CMakeLists.txt\n"
"├── package.xml\n"
"├── README.md\n"
"├── xacro/\n"
"│   ├── robot.xacro\n"
"│   ├── arm_mount.xacro\n"
